#: templates/product.html:32
msgid "Metodologia"
msgstr "Methodologie"

#: services/guides.py:35
msgid "Come Centropic misura AIO e GEO"
msgstr "Wie Centropic AIO und GEO misst"

#: services/guides.py:37
msgid ""
"Metodologia Centropic: score AIO/GEO da probe ed euristiche, badge "
"Misurato/Stimato, limiti del SoV proxy e percorso verso SoV measured."
msgstr ""
"Centropic-Methodik: AIO/GEO-Score aus Proben und Heuristiken, Badge "
"Gemessen/geschätzt, Grenzen des SoV-Proxys und Weg zu SoV gemessen."

#: services/guides.py:40
msgid ""
"Trasparenza sul metodo: cosa osserviamo sul sito, cosa stimiamo, cosa non"
" promettiamo."
msgstr ""
"Transparenz über die Methode: was wir auf der Website beobachten, was wir"
" schätzen, was wir nicht versprechen."

#: services/guides.py:43
msgid ""
"\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">1. Cosa osserviamo (Misurato)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Probe HTTP e parsing HTML sullo stesso dominio: "
"title, meta, JSON-LD, FAQ, robots, llms.txt, sitemap, ai.txt, humans.txt,"
" crawl multi-pagina. Questi finding possono essere badge "
"<em>Misurato</em>.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Centropic (centropic.ai) registra anche segnali di "
"entity (Organization, sameAs, contatti), citabilità del copy e policy "
"verso bot AI (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, Google-Extended).</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">2. Cosa stimiamo (Stimato / "
"proxy)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Score compositi AIO/GEO, indice DDD→AAA e Share of "
"Voice per engine derivano da formule euristiche sui segnali osservati. "
"Non sono, di default, citazioni live su ChatGPT/Perplexity/Claude.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Il breakdown per engine (ChatGPT, Gemini come proxy"
" AI Overview, Claude, Perplexity, Grok, Azure AI) resta etichettato "
"<em>Stimato</em> finché non gira il citation monitor Plus.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">3. SoV measured (Plus / "
"Business)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Su Plus e Business, con connector API configurati, "
"Centropic invia un prompt bank al citation monitor e conta le menzioni "
"del brand/dominio nelle risposte. È un campione probe, non un ranking "
"garantito nelle UI consumer degli LLM.</p>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Prompt personalizzabili in Impostazioni (prompt bank).</li>\n"
"      <li>Evidence badge <em>Misurato</em> per engine disponibili.</li>\n"
"      <li>Gemini e Azure AI sono proxy onesti (non Google AI Overview "
"nativo né Copilot Bing nativo).</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">4. Limiti</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Nessuna garanzia di ranking o menzione da parte di modelli di "
"terzi.</li>\n"
"      <li>Il pack artifact è una bozza operativa: la pubblicazione resta "
"a carico del cliente.</li>\n"
"      <li>SoV measured è disponibile su <strong>Plus e Business</strong> "
"(e Admin), quando i connector API sono configurati.</li>\n"
"      <li>GEO in Centropic non significa GIS; AIO non significa All-in-"
"One.</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">5. Approfondimenti</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/guida\">Guida completa Centropic (servizi, analisi, "
"glossario)</a></li>\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/guide/llms-txt\">Guida llms.txt</a></li>\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/guide/schema-ai\">Schema.org per answer "
"engine</a></li>\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/guide/score-vs-sov\">Score AIO/GEO vs Share of "
"Voice</a></li>\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/llms.txt\">llms.txt pubblico di Centropic</a></li>\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/prodotto\">Come funziona il prodotto</a></li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"  </section>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">1. Was wir beobachten "
"(Measured)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">HTTP-Probes und HTML-Parsing auf derselben Domain: "
"title, meta, JSON-LD, FAQ, robots, llms.txt, sitemap, ai.txt, humans.txt,"
" Multi-Page-Crawl. Diese Findings können mit dem Badge <em>Measured</em> "
"versehen sein.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Centropic (centropic.ai) erfasst außerdem Entity-"
"Signale (Organization, sameAs, Kontakte), Zitierbarkeit der Inhalte und "
"die Policy gegenüber KI-Bots (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, Google-"
"Extended).</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">2. Was wir schätzen (Estimated / "
"Proxy)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Zusammengesetzte AIO/GEO-Scores, der DDD→AAA-Index "
"und die Share of Voice je Engine ergeben sich aus heuristischen Formeln "
"auf beobachteten Signalen. Sie sind standardmäßig keine Live-Zitate auf "
"ChatGPT/Perplexity/Claude.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Das Breakdown je Engine (ChatGPT, Gemini als AI-"
"Overview-Proxy, Claude, Perplexity, Grok, Azure AI) bleibt als "
"<em>Estimated</em> gekennzeichnet, bis der Plus-Citation-Monitor "
"läuft.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">3. SoV measured (Plus / "
"Business)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Auf Plus und Business sendet Centropic bei "
"konfigurierten API-Connectoren eine Prompt Bank an den Citation Monitor "
"und zählt Marken-/Domain-Erwähnungen in den Antworten. Es ist eine Probe-"
"Stichprobe, kein garantiertes Ranking in Consumer-LLM-UIs.</p>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Anpassbare Prompts in den Einstellungen (Prompt Bank).</li>\n"
"      <li>Evidence-Badge <em>Measured</em> für verfügbare Engines.</li>\n"
"      <li>Gemini und Azure AI sind ehrliche Proxys (kein natives Google "
"AI Overview, kein natives Copilot Bing).</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">4. Grenzen</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Keine Garantie für Ranking oder Erwähnung durch "
"Drittmodelle.</li>\n"
"      <li>Das Pack-Artifact ist ein operativer Entwurf: die "
"Veröffentlichung bleibt Aufgabe des Kunden.</li>\n"
"      <li>SoV measured ist auf <strong>Plus und Business</strong> (und "
"Admin) verfügbar, wenn die API-Connectoren konfiguriert sind.</li>\n"
"      <li>GEO bei Centropic bedeutet nicht GIS; AIO bedeutet nicht All-"
"in-One.</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">5. Weiterführend</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/guida\">Vollständiger Centropic-Guide (Services, "
"Analyse, Glossar)</a></li>\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/guide/llms-txt\">llms.txt-Guide</a></li>\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/guide/schema-ai\">Schema.org für Answer "
"Engines</a></li>\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/guide/score-vs-sov\">Score AIO/GEO vs. Share of "
"Voice</a></li>\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/llms.txt\">Centropics öffentliche llms.txt</a></li>\n"
"      <li><a href=\"/prodotto\">So funktioniert das Produkt</a></li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"  </section>\n"

#: services/guides.py:91 services/guides.py:139 services/guides.py:183
#: templates/base.html:131 templates/base.html:147 templates/base.html:235
#: templates/guide.html:10 templates/partials/app_sidebar.html:68
msgid "Guida"
msgstr "Hilfe"

#: services/guides.py:92
msgid "llms.txt: guida pratica per la citabilità IA"
msgstr "llms.txt: praktische Anleitung zur AI-Zitierbarkeit"

#: services/guides.py:94
msgid ""
"Cos’è llms.txt, come strutturarlo per AIO/GEO e come Centropic lo genera "
"e lo valida nel crawl."
msgstr ""
"Was ist llms.txt, wie man es für AIO/GEO strukturiert und wie Centropic "
"es generiert und im Crawl validiert."

#: services/guides.py:97
msgid ""
"Un file root machine-readable che spiega brand, topic e pagine preferite "
"ai modelli e crawler AI."
msgstr ""
"Eine maschinenlesbare Root-Datei, die Marke, Thema und bevorzugte Seiten "
"für AI-Modelle und Crawler erklärt."

#: services/guides.py:100
msgid ""
"\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Perché conta</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">llms.txt riduce ambiguità entity: dice chi sei, "
"cosa offri e quali URL citare. In Centropic la presenza e la qualità del "
"file alimentano score AIO/GEO (probe Misurato).</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Answer engine e crawler AI (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, "
"PerplexityBot, Google-Extended) usano segnali pubblici; un llms.txt "
"chiaro è un’ancora di citazione accanto a Schema.org e robots "
"permissivi.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Sezioni utili</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Site / Summary / Key topics con brand e dominio canonici</li>\n"
"      <li>Preferred citation (brand + acronimi espansi: AIO, GEO)</li>\n"
"      <li>Important pages con URL https assoluti</li>\n"
"      <li>Disambiguazione (cosa non siete: GIS, All-in-One generici)</li>"
"\n"
"      <li>Contact e owner / parent organization</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Come Centropic aiuta</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Ogni analisi genera una bozza <code>llms.txt</code>"
" nel pack HTML unico. Pubblicala in root "
"(<code>https://tuodominio/llms.txt</code>) e ri-analizza: il finding "
"passa a “disponibile” se il probe la trova.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Esempio vivo: il llms.txt di Centropic è su <a "
"href=\"/llms.txt\">centropic.ai/llms.txt</a>, con preferred citation e "
"link a metodologia.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Checklist rapida</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Una sola brand primaria (evita nomi fantasma)</li>\n"
"      <li>URL canonici https, niente query di tracking</li>\n"
"      <li>Allinea llms.txt a JSON-LD Organization e alla home</li>\n"
"      <li>Aggiorna la data quando cambi offerta o positioning</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Vedi anche <a href=\"/guide/schema-ai\">Schema "
"AI</a> e <a href=\"/metodologia\">metodologia</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Warum es wichtig ist</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">llms.txt reduziert Entity-Mehrdeutigkeit: es sagt, "
"wer du bist, was du anbietest und welche URLs zitiert werden sollen. Bei "
"Centropic fließen Vorhandensein und Qualität der Datei in die AIO/GEO-"
"Scores ein (Measured-Probe).</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Answer Engines und KI-Crawler (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, "
"PerplexityBot, Google-Extended) nutzen öffentliche Signale; eine klare "
"llms.txt ist ein Zitat-Anker neben Schema.org und einer freigebenden "
"robots.txt.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Nützliche Abschnitte</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Site / Summary / Key Topics mit kanonischer Marke und "
"Domain</li>\n"
"      <li>Preferred Citation (Marke + ausgeschriebene Akronyme: AIO, "
"GEO)</li>\n"
"      <li>Important Pages mit absoluten https-URLs</li>\n"
"      <li>Disambiguation (was ihr nicht seid: GIS, generisches All-in-"
"One)</li>\n"
"      <li>Contact und Owner / übergeordnete Organisation</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Wie Centropic hilft</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Jede Analyse erzeugt einen Entwurf für "
"<code>llms.txt</code> im einzelnen HTML-Pack. Veröffentliche ihn im Root "
"(<code>https://deinedomain/llms.txt</code>) und analysiere erneut: das "
"Finding wird zu „verfügbar“, sobald die Probe ihn findet.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Live-Beispiel: Centropics eigene llms.txt liegt "
"unter <a href=\"/llms.txt\">centropic.ai/llms.txt</a>, mit Preferred "
"Citation und Link zur Methodik.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Schnelle Checkliste</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Eine einzige primäre Marke (vermeide Fantasienamen)</li>\n"
"      <li>Kanonische https-URLs, keine Tracking-Parameter</li>\n"
"      <li>llms.txt mit JSON-LD Organization und der Startseite "
"abstimmen</li>\n"
"      <li>Datum aktualisieren, wenn sich Angebot oder Positionierung "
"ändert</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Siehe auch <a href=\"/guide/schema-ai\">Schema "
"AI</a> und die <a href=\"/metodologia\">Methodik</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"

#: services/guides.py:140
msgid "Schema.org per answer engine (AIO/GEO)"
msgstr "Schema.org für Antwortmaschinen (AIO/GEO)"

#: services/guides.py:142
msgid ""
"Quali tipi Schema.org aiutano AI-Driven Visibility e Generative Engine "
"Optimization: Organization, WebSite, FAQPage, SoftwareApplication, "
"Article."
msgstr ""
"Welche Schema.org-Typen helfen bei AI-Driven Visibility und Generative "
"Engine Optimization: Organisation, Webseite, FAQ-Seite, "
"Softwareanwendung, Artikel."

#: services/guides.py:145
msgid ""
"I dati strutturati non “garantiscono” citazioni, ma rendono l’entity "
"leggibile a crawler e modelli. Aggiornato 30/07/2026."
msgstr ""
"Strukturierte Daten „garantieren“ keine Zitationen, machen die Entity "
"jedoch für Crawler und Modelle lesbar. Aktualisiert am 30.07.2026."

#: services/guides.py:148
msgid ""
"\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Tipi prioritari</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li><strong>Organization</strong> + <strong>WebSite</strong> "
"collegati via @id</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>FAQPage</strong> per Q&amp;A tipizzate allineate "
"all’HTML visibile</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>SoftwareApplication</strong> o Product se vendi "
"software (come Centropic)</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>Article</strong> / HowTo per guide evergreen con author"
" e date</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Riferimento normativo: <a "
"href=\"https://schema.org/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" "
"target=\"_blank\">schema.org</a>. In Centropic i tipi rilevati alimentano"
" score AIO/GEO (probe Misurato).</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Errori comuni</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">JSON-LD orfano senza tipi chiave, sameAs solo self-"
"referenziali, FAQ senza acceptedAnswer, Organization senza contatto o "
"logo. Centropic li segnala nei findings.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Un sameAs verso il solo sito proprietario non "
"basta: preferisci profili esterni reali (azienda madre, directory, social"
" verificati).</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Checklist minima</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>name + url + email (o telephone) su Organization</li>\n"
"      <li>sameAs verso profili esterni reali (non pagine interne del "
"sito)</li>\n"
"      <li>logo ImageObject con URL assoluto https e caption</li>\n"
"      <li>FAQPage solo se le domande sono visibili in pagina</li>\n"
"      <li>knowsAbout allineato a llms.txt e al copy della home</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Vedi anche <a "
"href=\"/metodologia\">metodologia</a>, <a href=\"/guide/llms-"
"txt\">llms.txt</a> e <a href=\"/guide/score-vs-sov\">score vs "
"SoV</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
msgstr ""
"<section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Prioritäre Typen</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li><strong>Organisation</strong> + <strong>Webseite</strong> "
"verbunden über @id</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>FAQPage</strong> für typisierte Q&amp;A, die mit dem "
"sichtbaren HTML übereinstimmen</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>Softwareanwendung</strong> oder Produkt, wenn du "
"Software verkaufst (wie Centropic)</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>Artikel</strong> / HowTo für Evergreen-Guides mit Autor"
" und Datum</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Normative Referenz: <a href=\"https://schema.org/\""
" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">schema.org</a>. In "
"Centropic speisen die erkannten Typen die AIO/GEO-Scores (Probe "
"Gemessen).</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Häufige Fehler</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">JSON-LD verwaist ohne Schlüsseltypen, sameAs nur "
"selbstreferenziell, FAQ ohne acceptedAnswer, Organisation ohne Kontakt "
"oder Logo. Centropic weist sie in den Ergebnissen aus.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Ein sameAs nur zur eigenen Website reicht nicht "
"aus: bevorzuge echte externe Profile (Muttergesellschaft, Verzeichnisse, "
"verifizierte soziale Medien).</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Minimale Checkliste</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Name + URL + E-Mail (oder Telefon) bei Organisation</li>\n"
"      <li>sameAs zu echten externen Profilen (nicht interne Seiten der "
"Website)</li>\n"
"      <li>Logo ImageObject mit absoluter https-URL und "
"Bildunterschrift</li>\n"
"      <li>FAQPage nur, wenn die Fragen auf der Seite sichtbar sind</li>\n"
"      <li>knowsAbout abgestimmt auf llms.txt und den Text der "
"Startseite</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Siehe auch <a href=\"/metodologia\">Methodik</a>, "
"<a href=\"/guide/llms-txt\">llms.txt</a> und <a href=\"/guide/score-vs-"
"sov\">Score vs SoV</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>"

#: services/guides.py:184
msgid "Score AIO/GEO vs Share of Voice"
msgstr "Score AIO/GEO vs Share of Voice"

#: services/guides.py:186
msgid ""
"Differenza tra score AIO/GEO (diagnostica probe) e Share of Voice per "
"answer engine (proxy o measured) in Centropic."
msgstr ""
"Unterschied zwischen AIO/GEO-Score (Diagnoseprobe) und Share of Voice für"
" Antwortmaschinen (Proxy oder gemessen) in Centropic."

#: services/guides.py:189
msgid ""
"Due metriche diverse: una valuta i segnali sul sito, l’altra stima la "
"presenza relativa negli engine."
msgstr ""
"Zwei verschiedene Metriken: eine bewertet die Signale auf der Website, "
"die andere schätzt die relative Präsenz in den Engines."

#: services/guides.py:192
msgid ""
"\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Score AIO / GEO</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Indici 0–100 da crawl e probe. Badge Stimato sul "
"compositario; singoli check di presenza file possono essere Misurato.</p>"
"\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\"><strong>AIO (AI-Driven Visibility)</strong> premia "
"leggibilità per sistemi IA: entity, schema, FAQ, llms.txt, meta. "
"<strong>GEO (Generative Engine Optimization)</strong> premia citabilità e"
" policy crawler AI.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Share of Voice (SoV)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\"><strong>Proxy</strong>: formula su AIO/GEO + robots"
" osservato. <strong>Measured</strong>: polling prompt su LLM "
"(Plus/Business) con conteggio menzioni brand. Non confondere i due.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Per alzare SoV measured: rafforza entity pubblica "
"(llms.txt, Organization, about), pubblica contenuti citabili, amplia il "
"prompt bank con domande che il tuo mercato pone davvero.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Come leggerli insieme</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Alza prima i segnali (score), poi misura la voce "
"(SoV). Un SoV alto con score basso è fragile; score alto senza SoV "
"measured resta una diagnosi, non una prova di citazione.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Centropic mostra l’evidence badge su ogni finding: "
"Stimato, Misto o Misurato. Dettagli in <a "
"href=\"/metodologia\">metodologia</a> e nel prodotto su <a "
"href=\"/prodotto\">/prodotto</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
msgstr ""
"<section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Score AIO / GEO</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Indizes 0–100 von Crawl und Probe. Geschätztes "
"Badge auf dem Komposit; einzelne Dateiprüfungen können gemessen "
"werden.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\"><strong>AIO (AI-Driven Visibility)</strong> belohnt"
" Lesbarkeit für KI-Systeme: Entity, Schema, FAQ, llms.txt, Meta. "
"<strong>GEO (Generative Engine Optimization)</strong> belohnt "
"Zitierbarkeit und KI-Crawler-Richtlinien.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Share of Voice (SoV)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\"><strong>Proxy</strong>: Formel zu AIO/GEO + "
"beobachtete Robots. <strong>Measured</strong>: Umfrageaufforderung zu LLM"
" (Plus/Business) mit Zählung der Markenmentions. Verwechsle die beiden "
"nicht.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Um SoV measured zu erhöhen: verstärke öffentliche "
"Entities (llms.txt, Organization, about), veröffentliche zitierbare "
"Inhalte, erweitere die Prompt-Bank mit Fragen, die dein Markt wirklich "
"stellt.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Wie man sie zusammen liest</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Erhöhe zuerst die Signale (Score), dann messe die "
"Stimme (SoV). Ein hoher SoV mit niedrigem Score ist fragil; ein hoher "
"Score ohne SoV measured bleibt eine Diagnose, kein Beweis für "
"Zitierung.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Centropic zeigt das Evidence-Badge bei jedem "
"Finding: Geschätzt, Gemischt oder Gemessen. Details in <a "
"href=\"/metodologia\">Methodologie</a> und im Produkt auf <a "
"href=\"/prodotto\">/prodotto</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>"

